    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6776" root="جوه" body-key="j">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جوّه</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجاه</span></b>  are rendered by Golius <i>Ad
dignitatem evexit: spectabilem reddidit:</i> as on
the authority of the S: but in my copies of the S
the two verbs are <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اوجه</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وجّه</span>; and belong to
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وجه</span>, though mentioned in the present art.]

